            "review_title": "Review at Eat Me",
            "review_text": "Caleb H\n2 contributions\n0\nAmazing Place\nNov 2025 • Solo\nI really can’t recommend this place enough. Every item on the menu got there through the personal experience of the owner, and no matter what you get it will be so incredibly worth it. I came here and had one of the most profound experiences of my life, and if you have nowhere you need to be and want somewhere to spend some time and have some good food and conversation I truly believe there is no better place you can go in the world.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nWritten November 9, 2025",
