            "review_title": "Review at Eat Me",
            "review_text": "Venture14464396648\n20 contributions\n0\nWhile i was in HCHM i ate there every day , sometimes even twice.\nOct 2023 • Solo\n\"Eat Me\" is a great place in Hochiminh City .easy to get to by grab app .the food is prepared freshly every day and you can even look how everything is cooked .a big variety of burgers , sandwiches and even tacos (each of them individually made)\nA deliciously selected menu , one customer(told me ) he would try the whole menu ,step by step ... it is a small place , but very clean . Go there , try it you will love it .\nRead more\nWritten November 4, 2023\nEat Me\nThanx to you:)) we are no longer strangers, so whenever you come back to the Nam, see ya later:))\nWritten November 4, 2023\nThis response is the subjective opinion of the management representative and not of Tripadvisor LLC nor of its partners.",
